# Frontend Integration for Numista-AI

This plan outlines the creation of a professional web interface to interact with the coin capture server.

## Proposed Changes

### [Frontend Component]

#### [NEW] [index.html](file:///c:/Users/ericd/Documents/MyVertexProject/AJ%27s%20AI%20Coin%20Collection%20app/index.html)
A single-file solution containing:
- **HTML5 Semantic Structure**: Header, Main, and Report sections.
- **Premium CSS Styling**: 
  - Dark professional theme (Slate & Gold accents).
  - Responsive layout for desktop and tablet.
  - Animations for status transitions.
- **JavaScript Logic**:
  - `startScan()`: Calls `POST /start-scan`.
  - `pollStatus()`: Fetches `GET /get-status` every 1s when active.
  - UI Updates: Maps backend states (OBVERSE, REVERSE, ANALYZING) to user-friendly messages.
  - Report Rendering: Extracts and formats the Gemini AI report data into an elegant display.

## Design Aesthetics
- **Color Palette**: Deep Charcoal (#1a1a1a), Antique Gold (#d4af37), and Soft White.
- **Typography**: Professional sans-serif (Inter/Roboto) via Google Fonts.
- **Components**: Polished "Scan" button, high-contrast status badge, and silver-bordered report card.

